# The life mode gives the targeted player twice X life in one instruction (CR 119.3, 700.2).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Heliod's Intervention
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Heliod's Intervention.Cast(X: 2)
! Bot1.Modes(Count: 0)
Bot1.Modes(2)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 24
